## Byte custody
- **Policy:** the tracked `.gitattributes` keeps `/imports`, `/labs`, `/notes`, `/packs`, `/returns` and `/00.kernel` as `-text`; everything else is `text=auto eol=lf` (addendum 001 #B-A03).
- **Checks:** `labs/bootstrap-git-bytes-pass01/gitbytes.py` checks effective attributes, worktree bytes, the index blob before commit, and `COMMIT:path` after commit, for every custody manifest. Its fixture gate is in `labs/bootstrap-git-bytes-pass01/evidence/`.
- **Manifests:** the original 39-file baseline is `manifests/pack-workspace-baseline.tsv` (immutable). The additive baseline is `labs/bootstrap-establish-pass01/evidence/step02/baseline-capture/additive-baseline-2026-10-26.tsv`. The import custody is `manifests/step03-custody-imports.tsv`. The new drafts and evidence are recorded at the evidence boundary (`0501.bootstrap/05.02.md`).

